"Rhys Foundling came from Earth into a dead orphan of the mountain village; he is now high Tier 5."
"Rhys is across the storm wall in an island nation, retainer to its Third Prince Ryota."
"This season Rhys is in the islands' floating rainbow capital, hunting idle princes' potential."
"Rhys's path is trash, acknowledged by the world; he burns trash in a core like a black hole."
"Rhys is loosely courting Mouse, and means to come back to her when his work oversea is done."
"Rhys keeps a void island as his fortress, reached by little portal hoops he scatters."
"Ryota Agaric, Third Prince across the sea, is Tier 5, kind, cowardly, and made a god by Rhys."
"Bast is in the Alliance capital, leading the Alliance until an election, eager to catch Rhys up."
"Mouse, called Mauve, stays in the Alliance: a Tier 2 or 3 girl whose path is going unseen."
"Mouse can erase herself from memory, and was Virgil's adopted daughter until he fell."
"Sable, Sid's daughter, has bony spider limbs and a tail, loves fighting, and is Rhys's friend."
"Lira, an exiled water sprite with a raining umbrella, is across the sea, her home's affairs."
"Az is a tuxedo cat spirit, a librarian older than the Demon King, who steals libraries whole."
"Az was last in the islands' capital, robbing its library vault."
"Laurent, white-haired Empire officer, tore out Rhys's core once and loves Rhys's girl guise Rina."
"Ev, a girl martial artist who passes as a boy, is a Tier 3 fighter somewhere in the Alliance."
"The orphan bullies Tam and Den, and the matron, still live in the mountain village's orphanage."
"Straw counsels Bast now as a shadow of faint straw bits, far from what he was."
"Sid and Soma counsel Bast; both are far past Tier 5 and hid it long."
"Illya Traje is in the capital with Briar Heart; she lost to Soma trying to recapture Straw."
"Ernesto is in the capital, fallen to Tier 3, his curse lab found out."
"Mirai and Grave live in the northern ice city; Grave is a 300-year-old servant of Tier 3."
"Aquari hoards trash in her manor, and her school owes debts to every school near it."
"None of these people are anywhere near Ashford, and none has heard of Nala."
